meta {
  name: Export Preview
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exports/preview
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  What a ledger export would contain: row counts, the date span, the stable
  column list, the record policy, and what the export leaves behind. Answered
  before any bytes stream, which is why it is the place a bad request can still
  fail with an error envelope.
}
